# ArcadeClash Monorepo Environment Configuration Guide
#
# ArcadeClash uses environment variables separated by workspace package:
#
# 1. Backend Server Package (packages/server):
#    Copy packages/server/.env.example -> packages/server/.env
#    - DATABASE_URL (PostgreSQL database connection)
#    - JWT_SECRET (Session cookie signing key)
#
# 2. Frontend Client Package (packages/client):
#    Copy packages/client/.env.example -> packages/client/.env.local
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_URL (Supabase public project URL)
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (Supabase public anon client key)
#    - VITE_API_URL (Backend API URL)
